<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result for the 2.5 trillion lire auction of a third tranche of two-year Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ).</p>
<p>			   Aug 31, 1998	Previous</p>
<p>Net Yield		  7.00 pct   vs    7.24 pct</p>
<p>Gross Yield		7.99 pct   vs    8.23 pct</p>
<p>Assigned price	  86.00	 vs   85.35</p>
<p>Bids			6.468 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned		  2.5  trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction of a first tranche of August 31, 1998 Ctzs on August 26.</p>
</text>
